description:
Recommends books from the ReadingRate catalog for this reader, matched to the difficulty range they usually read, the genres and themes they return to, and their reading pace, with the reasons for each pick and a reading-time estimate at their pace. Books they have already finished are left out. It can draw only from their want-to-read list, leave out genres, or reach a little above their usual difficulty.

Use when the reader asks what to read next, or which books would suit them.

Examples:
- {}
- {"from_tbr": true}
- {"difficulty_stretch": true, "exclude_genres": ["Horror"]}
